@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title UML state — extraction acceptance / baseline 1.0
[*] --> Pending : valid candidates saved
Pending --> Accepted : confirm / validated autoconfirm
Pending --> Rejected : owner rejects
Accepted --> Superseded : fact correction / new revision
Accepted --> Stale : basis revised
Stale --> Superseded : rebuild replaces interpretation
Rejected --> [*]
Superseded --> [*]
note right of Pending
No active inference lease while waiting.
Autoconfirm does not change hypothesis source kind.
end note
@enduml
